  "id": "display-design",
  "term": "display design",
  "definition": "In this context, display design means arranging a vibrotactile display so it works effectively for real-time use. It involves choosing features such as where tactors are placed, how many are used, what type they are, and other stimulus characteristics that can affect reaction time.",
